    "summary": "1 review\nRich Hann  recommends Manzur Gentlemens Hairdressers.\n\nManzur’s been cutting my hair for 23 years...awesome hair cuts, decent price and the most friendly team you will ever find\nFantastic haircuts\nBest barbershop\nAffordable haircuts\nGreat haircuts\n1\n1\nManzur Asghar\n\n6y\nThank you so much for your kind words mate\nReply",
